    <briefdescription>
<para>A tick label formatter that produces power-of-ten labels for logarithmic axes. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Formats each power-of-ten tick value using a superscript exponent, such as &quot;10²&quot;.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1NumericTickLabelFormatter" kindref="compound">NumericTickLabelFormatter</ref>, <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1TickLabelFormatter" kindref="compound">TickLabelFormatter</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
